The consortium's journalists reviewed more than 2,000 leaked Bauman University documents and published an investigation based on them, not the documents themselves. The outlets attribute the 2017 Macron campaign breach differently (Sandworm in the Guardian and Meduza, Fancy Bear in Le Monde), and none of them reports continuing 2025 to 2026 APT28 activity against EU government or election targets. The curriculum details are now cited to the outlets that carry them, including VSquare for the Metasploit training against US Department of Defense networks.
